# The downloaded figures. ~8.6 MB of JPEG that nothing needs after the first
# build: packFigure writes content/enc/img/, that IS committed, and it skips
# any figure already there. So a fresh clone rebuilds the whole pack without
# ImageMagick and without the site being up.
#
# The article HTML next to this is NOT ignored, on purpose — it is 600 KB, it
# is the actual source of every converted formula, and matesspace.h1n.ru is one
# person's shared host with no archive behind it.
cache/img/
